      "id": "a9b81858074b",
      "name": "Server Sentinel",
      "prompt": "Jalankan `/home/barzzly/.hermes/scripts/vps-sentinel.py`, baca JSON telemetri, lalu kirim satu laporan ringkas Bahasa Indonesia di chat ini.\n\nStruktur laporan wajib dalam 1 pesan dengan format title BOLD, nama service BOLD, status BOLD, serta jarak 1 baris kosong (blank line) antara judul kategori dengan service pertamanya:\n\n**Laporan Telemetri Server Sentinel ([timestamp])**\n\n**Metrik Sistem VPS:**\n\n- CPU Load: ...\n- RAM: ...\n- Disk: ...\n\n**Status Service VPS:**\n\n- **OS-Ubuntu (Host VPS)**: status **ONLINE**, health OK, uptime ..., CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **AI-Router-BarzzLy**: status **ONLINE**, health OK, uptime ..., CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **Noesantara-Store**: status **ONLINE**, health OK, uptime ..., CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **MariaDB**: status **ONLINE**, health OK, uptime ..., CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **Nginx**: status **ONLINE**, health OK, uptime ..., CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **BarzzLyp-Agent-Gateway**: status **ONLINE**, health OK, uptime ..., CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **NOESANTARA BOT DC** (400a3758): status **RUNNING**, CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **NOESANTARA RP REBEL** (237a7813): status **RUNNING**, CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **NOESANTARA VELOCITY** (5067ef6a): status **OFFLINE**, CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n- **NOESANTARA DEV/EVENT** (aef340ed): status **OFFLINE**, CPU ..., RAM ...\n\n**Status Service C-Ultras:**\n\n- **[Nama Server]** ([Identifier]): status **[STATUS]**, CPU [cpu], RAM [ram]\n(Beri 1 baris kosong di antara setiap server)\n\nATURAN FORMAT:\n- Title/Kategori wajib BOLD (**Title**). Gunakan judul tepat: **Metrik Sistem VPS:**.\n- Nama service/server wajib BOLD (**Nama Service**).\n- Nilai status wajib BOLD (status **ONLINE** / status **RUNNING** / status **OFFLINE** / status **SUSPENDED**).\n- WAJIB beri 1 baris kosong (jarak 1 enter kosong) antara judul kategori dengan item pertama di bawahnya.\n- WAJIB beri 1 baris kosong di antara setiap baris service/server agar rapi.\n- Noesantara-Discord-Bot DILARANG dimasukkan ke dalam daftar laporan VPS.\n- Hanya sebut “sempat down / recovered” jika `actions_taken` benar-benar memuat action recovery. Tetap gunakan ag/ model.",
